I had only 2 full days at the DEVI School!

No messing around! I had a bucket list, and time was ticking!

6am - bike ride with Luke (check the strava)

8am - morning meditation with everyone

10am - work + volunteering (painting new house)

3pm - Charleston loop (7.7km run)

8pm - Kayaking with the gang (Luke & Rohit capsized)

